The recursive draft translated and passed Python tests, but the supplied semantics expands `[1:]` through a low-level symbolic slice builder. That would make the proof depend on an extra sequence-reconstruction lemma unrelated to XOR. I’m switching to the semantics’ native `zip` iterator and will prove it with a direct loop invariant over the remaining input sequences and accumulated output.
